culator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2025 the middle ran 34% of normal in January to February and 60% in October to November. Grid 28359 had its driest year in 1958, at 52% of normal.</p>"}
